          "explanation": "The model clarifies whether the patient has already had angiography, whether a stent was placed, and what the current care setting is.",
          "quote": "明确下一步是否需要做血管造影检查，以及是否需要支架治疗"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The doctor explicitly asked about the procedural state and adjusted the plan based on the family’s confirmation that no intervention had yet been performed.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
